WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.230 --> 00:00:02.300
- But yes, I was in one
of your music videos

00:00:02.300 --> 00:00:03.392
for Behind These Hazel Eyes.

00:00:03.392 --> 00:00:04.540
- [Kelly] The wedding, yes.

00:00:04.540 --> 00:00:05.810
- The wedding, I was a wedding guest.

00:00:05.810 --> 00:00:08.440
And yeah, there was a scene where you run

00:00:08.440 --> 00:00:10.820
down the aisle of the church,

00:00:10.820 --> 00:00:11.960
fling open the doors.

00:00:11.960 --> 00:00:13.480
- Well, you don't know this part.

00:00:13.480 --> 00:00:14.590
Joseph Kahn who directed it,

00:00:14.590 --> 00:00:16.320
who's like directs
movies, he's incredible.

00:00:16.320 --> 00:00:17.770
And he's done a ton of my videos.

00:00:17.770 --> 00:00:21.710
No one actually told me
that there were stairs

00:00:21.710 --> 00:00:23.350
when you open the doors.

00:00:23.350 --> 00:00:25.610
And I am full on.

00:00:25.610 --> 00:00:27.250
I don't know if you've noticed.

00:00:27.250 --> 00:00:29.630
So, like, I literally, in that video,

00:00:29.630 --> 00:00:31.630
they said, we want you to
run out 'cause you're so mad

00:00:31.630 --> 00:00:34.480
'cause your bridesmaid
has been with your man

00:00:34.480 --> 00:00:35.900
and it's like this whole thing.

00:00:35.900 --> 00:00:37.380
And I was like okay.

00:00:37.380 --> 00:00:39.580
So I was in track.

00:00:39.580 --> 00:00:41.370
I ran.

00:00:41.370 --> 00:00:44.580
And I ran so hard, I didn't actually fall,

00:00:44.580 --> 00:00:47.060
I like flew down the stairs

00:00:47.060 --> 00:00:48.380
like with this giant dress.

00:00:48.380 --> 00:00:50.245
Didn't get one bruise, thank you.

00:00:50.245 --> 00:00:53.000
(audience cheering)

00:00:53.000 --> 00:00:57.410
- Now, I feel like what
you didn't get to see

00:00:57.410 --> 00:00:58.910
was what I saw.

00:00:58.910 --> 00:01:00.330
- [Kelly] Kelly Clarkson die.

00:01:00.330 --> 00:01:02.750
- The direction for the
people at the wedding

00:01:02.750 --> 00:01:04.410
was Kelly's gonna run by you.

00:01:04.410 --> 00:01:07.100
You're shocked, you're
stunned, there's drama.

00:01:07.100 --> 00:01:09.430
And watch her as she runs through.

00:01:09.430 --> 00:01:11.630
So, we all were watching you.

00:01:11.630 --> 00:01:13.510
We watched the doors fling open,

00:01:13.510 --> 00:01:16.802
and then we watched you free fall forward.

00:01:16.802 --> 00:01:18.220
- It was like (laughing).

00:01:18.220 --> 00:01:20.170
- Down a set of stairs,

00:01:20.170 --> 00:01:22.377
and then there was like an odd calm.

00:01:22.377 --> 00:01:25.640
- Pause, and you can
hear everybody go (gasp).

00:01:25.640 --> 00:01:26.690
- Is she?

00:01:26.690 --> 00:01:27.523
- Dead?

00:01:27.523 --> 00:01:29.150
- Still alive?

00:01:29.150 --> 00:01:30.730
What happened to her?

00:01:30.730 --> 00:01:33.960
And I remember it was like 15 second,

00:01:33.960 --> 00:01:35.380
like deafening silence,

00:01:35.380 --> 00:01:38.391
and then we hear from down
the stairs, "I'm good!"

00:01:38.391 --> 00:01:40.516
(laughing)

00:01:40.516 --> 00:01:42.390
- I think I literally got up

00:01:42.390 --> 00:01:44.610
and did the like Mary Katherine Gallagher.

00:01:44.610 --> 00:01:45.763
- [Danny] In a full wedding
dress, too, I might add.

00:01:45.763 --> 00:01:47.500
- And a full wedding dress.

00:01:47.500 --> 00:01:49.390
Yeah, and I literally looked at Joseph

00:01:49.390 --> 00:01:51.110
and was like thanks for the heads up

00:01:51.110 --> 00:01:52.288
with the whole stair scenario.

00:01:52.288 --> 00:01:54.020
- That could have gone a different way.

00:01:54.020 --> 00:01:56.340
- We actually have video
of Danny's big moment

00:01:56.340 --> 00:01:57.872
in my video, as well.

00:01:57.872 --> 00:02:01.400
(audience cheering)

00:02:01.400 --> 00:02:02.920
- [Danny] Okay.

00:02:02.920 --> 00:02:04.423
There, wait, can you see me?

00:02:05.360 --> 00:02:06.193
There I am!

00:02:06.193 --> 00:02:07.138
There I am!

00:02:07.138 --> 00:02:07.971
- [Kelly] Yeah!

00:02:07.971 --> 00:02:09.120
There I am, there I am.

00:02:09.120 --> 00:02:10.504
- Hold on, there I am!

00:02:10.504 --> 00:02:13.837
(audience cheering)
Yes!

00:02:15.954 --> 00:02:18.422
- I feel like when you
have to go "there I am!

00:02:18.422 --> 00:02:19.255
"Oh wait, there!

00:02:19.255 --> 00:02:20.088
"There I am!"

00:02:20.088 --> 00:02:22.080
I feel like it's not a starring role.

00:02:22.080 --> 00:02:24.277
- Welcome to my early acting career.

